00:06:36.744 --> 00:06:40.776
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:41.375 --> 00:06:47.663
<v Slow>探査機「MMX」は、どこへ行きますか。

00:06:48.463 --> 00:06:51.536
<v Host>To Phobos — one of the two moons of Mars.

00:06:52.136 --> 00:06:58.663
<v Slow>「MMX」は、フォボスで、何を取りますか。

00:06:59.463 --> 00:07:04.767
<v Host>Sand. It will bring the sand back to Earth so scientists can study it.

00:07:05.367 --> 00:07:10.791
<v Slow>探査機が地球に帰るのは、いつですか。

00:07:11.591 --> 00:07:16.295
<v Host>In twenty thirty-one — after a long journey of about five years.

00:07:16.896 --> 00:07:27.360
<v Host>That's all for today. A small probe, a very long trip to the moon of Mars — the launch is set for October, and we will be watching. See you next time!

00:07:27.959 --> 00:07:30.360
<v News>また明日。
